    #
    # More info about extended attributes for media:
    #   http://freedesktop.org/wiki/CommonExtendedAttributes/
    #   http://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/PhreedomDraft/
    #   http://dublincore.org/documents/usageguide/elements.shtml
